Measured basis (agents/seam_fp/out_f4_*.txt, out_pr1_prefill_model.txt)
- FA3 cold prefill at an empty queue: ttft = 0.05 s + 12.3-13.4 us x n + 0.69-0.72 ns x n^2 (campaign 33 n 503;
  campaign 34 n 60-62): 0.20 s at 8K, 0.76 s at 24K, 2.3 s at 48K. Not a constant per token.
- A read issued at arrival with nobody ahead keeps its turn in the queue 65-206 ms + 37-53 us a token
  (lookup 19 ms, I/O 2.4-2.9 ms a page, landing -> admission 16-19 ms).
- For the readers that arrived alone, measured TTFT against the model's recompute: recompute faster for 101 of
  105 (campaign 34 ec_full), 25 of 25 (jit_exact), 30 of 30 (ec_exact), 14 of 16 (campaign 33 ec_full); median gain
  0.14 to 0.33 s each; 0.5 to 2.3 ms per request of the run.
